# The Web bundle does not contain an agentd endpoint. The first-run screen
# imports the connection profile from the pairing QR at runtime.
#
# Optional browser-development overrides. `mise run dev-serve` derives the
# proxy target automatically; these are only for running Vite directly.
# VITE_AGENTD_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:4317
# VITE_ALLOWED_HOSTS=your-machine.tailnet.ts.net
